<title>USA: Coastal buys Main Pass Gas Gathering stake.</title>
<headline>Coastal buys Main Pass Gas Gathering stake.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coastal Corp said Tuesday its subsidiary Coastal Field Services Co has acquired a one-third interest in Main Pass Gas Gathering Co, operator of the Main Pass Gas Gathering System, serving the Main Pass region of the Gulf of Mexico, offshore Louisiana and Mississippi.</p>
<p>Coastal Field Services' stake was acquired by purchasing equal shares from each of the company's original partners, Consolidated Natural Gas Co's CNG Main Pass Gas Gathering Corp and PanEnergy Corp's Centana Gathering Co, for undisclosed terms.</p>
</text>
